{
  "$comment": [
    "OPTIONAL. Copy to settings.local.json (it is in .gitignore).",
    "Overrides settings.json, higher priority.",
    "",
    "── TURNING AGENT TEAMS OFF ───────────────────────────────────────────────",
    "Teams are ON by project default (settings.json). `/auftrag` decides",
    "by itself whether to use them: only in M2/M3 with 3+ independent pages.",
    "",
    "To switch them off completely for a project, set the variable to \"0\":",
    "  \"env\": { \"CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS\": \"0\" }",
    "",
    "Reasons that can speak for it:",
    "  · Token budget: usage scales linearly with the number of teammates",
    "  · On Windows in-process only, no split panes (no tmux/iTerm2)",
    "  · /resume does not restore in-process teammates",
    "  · Task status occasionally hangs and blocks dependent tasks",
    "",
    "── WHAT IS DIFFERENT IN TEAM MODE ─────────────────────────────────────────",
    "From the agent definition, for a teammate:",
    "  applies:         tools:  ·  model:",
    "  does NOT apply:  skills:  ·  mcpServers:  ·  effort:",
    "Teammates load all MCP servers from .mcp.json and have to fetch skills via",
    "the Skill tool. That is why `Skill` is in `tools:` for all nine agents.",
    "The spawn prompt must name the needed skill explicitly.",
    "",
    "Important: `tools:` still applies, so `aesthetic` stays unable to write even",
    "as a teammate. The critic's structural strictness survives team mode.",
    "",
    "── DISPLAY MODE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────",
    "The key is `teammateMode` (string). Checked against the official schema:",
    "`teammateModeEnabled` does NOT exist (an earlier docs summary got it wrong).",
    "Values: \"in-process\" (default) | \"auto\" | \"tmux\" | \"iterm2\".",
    "On Windows only \"in-process\" makes sense; split panes need tmux or iTerm2.",
    "It belongs in ~/.claude/settings.json rather than in the project anyway.",
    "",
    "── CHECK BEFORE SAVING ───────────────────────────────────────────────────",
    "  node .claude/validate-settings.mjs",
    "Claude Code skips a file with a schema error ENTIRELY, not just the broken",
    "field. One typo silently disables all hooks and permissions.",
    "",
    "── AUTOPILOT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────",
    "Autopilot is not a setting but a decision made by /auftrag: it switches",
    "on for an open mandate (\"make this 20x better\"). If you never want it,",
    "say so in the order (\"ask me about every concept\")."
  ],

  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_EXPERIMENTAL_AGENT_TEAMS": "0"
  }
}
